Aleisha McCall is a Marketing, Media & AI Transformation Strategist, industry keynote speaker, multi-award winner, and a ten-time recipient of the B&T Women in Media Power List. She is also the host of [The Black Box of Media](https://www.ultimateedgecommunications.com.au/the-black-box-of-media-podcast/) podcast, where she lifts the lid on the hidden strategies behind high-performance media advertising, interviewing marketing leaders, media experts, and brand executives to uncover the tactics that consistently deliver market-beating results.

As Founder & CEO of Ultimate Edge Communications, Aleisha helps organisations redesign their marketing and media advertising operating models for the AI era. Over the past two decades, she has led more than $100 million in marketing investment, generating over $500 million in client revenue and more than 1 million leads. She works with senior executives and their teams to eliminate fragmented marketing practices, integrate AI into commercial operations, and deliver measurable, high-ROI business outcomes.
